{
  "skill": "board",
  "note": "Turns the venture stage into behavior. The board skill reads Overview.md's stage (reconciled with the real signals in references/lifecycle.md) and activates the matching row: the operating stage, the active playbook, the next required milestone, the seats to convene, and the rigor and metrics defaults.",
  "stages": {
